<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>TerraHike — Hiking & Outdoor Gear</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :root {
      --green-dark: #173b2a;
      --green: #2f6b4f;
      --green-light: #dcebdd;
      --cream: #f5f1e8;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #243027;
      --muted: #6b756e;
      --orange: #d9783c;
      --shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(23, 59, 42, 0.12);
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--cream);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    /* NAVBAR */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(23, 59, 42, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .logo {
      color: white;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #9ed08c;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 30px;
      list-style: none;
      color: white;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: #a8d995;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: var(--orange);
      color: white;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 150px 7% 80px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: white;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(12, 34, 24, .88), rgba(12, 34, 24, .25)),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #315c46, #102b1d);
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      right: -150px;
      top: 100px;
      background: rgba(153, 203, 133, .12);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 680px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(45px, 7vw, 82px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #a9d890;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 570px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #dbe5dc;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: .3s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--orange);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      background: #c66731;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: white;
      color: var(--green-dark);
    }

    /* GENERAL */
    section {
      padding: 100px 7%;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .section-heading .label {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 50px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      margin: 10px 0 15px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* GEAR */
    .gear-section {
      background: #fff;
    }

    .gear-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .gear-card {
      background: #fafaf7;
      border: 1px solid #e7e8e1;
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: .35s;
    }

    .gear-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .gear-image {
      height: 220px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 75px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe9dc, #eef2e8);
    }

    .gear-info {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .gear-info small {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .gear-info h3 {
      margin: 7px 0;
      color: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .gear-info p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .price {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .price a {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green-dark);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* FEATURES */
    .features {
      background: var(--green-dark);
      color: white;
    }

    .features .section-heading h2 {
      color: white;
    }

    .features .section-heading p {
      color: #cbd8cf;
    }

    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 35px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .feature p {
      color: #bfcfc4;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* TIPS */
    .tips-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr;
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .tip-main {
      padding: 45px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #dcebdd;
    }

    .tip-main h3 {
      font-size: 30px;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .tip-main p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .tip-list {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .tip-list li {
      margin: 13px 0;
      padding-left: 28px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .tip-list li::before {
      content: "✓";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .tip-side {
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--orange);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .tip-side h3 {
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .tip-side p {
      color: #ffe8d9;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta {
      padding: 80px 7%;
      background: #fff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-box {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 70px 30px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(23,59,42,.95), rgba(47,107,79,.95));
      color: white;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .cta p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      color: #dce8df;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 40px 7%;
      background: #10291d;
      color: #aebeb3;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: white;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .gear-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .feature-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .tips-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav {
        padding: 17px 5%;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 130px 6% 70px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 70px 6%;
      }

      .gear-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .gear-image {
        height: 190px;
      }

      .tip-main,
      .tip-side {
        padding: 30px;
      }

      footer {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- NAVBAR -->
  <nav>
    <a href="#" class="logo">Terra<span>Hike</span></a>

    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#gear">Gear</a></li>
      <li><a href="#tips">Tips</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">Tentang</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Mulai Hiking</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE • HIKE • REPEAT</span>

      <h1>
        Temukan Jejakmu.<br>
        <span>Taklukkan Alam.</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        Panduan hiking, rekomendasi perlengkapan outdoor, dan inspirasi
        petualangan untuk menemani setiap langkahmu menuju puncak.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#gear" class="btn btn-primary">Lihat Gear</a>
        <a href="#tips" class="btn btn-outline">Tips Pendakian</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- GEAR -->
  <section class="gear-section" id="gear">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="label">Outdoor Essentials</span>
      <h2>Gear pilihan untuk petualanganmu.</h2>
      <p>
        Perlengkapan yang tepat membuat perjalanan lebih nyaman,
        aman, dan menyenangkan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gear-grid">

      <article class="gear-card">
        <div class="gear-image">🎒</div>
        <div class="gear-info">
          <small>BACKPACK</small>
          <h3>Trail Backpack 40L</h3>
          <p>
            Tas hiking ringan dengan kapasitas ideal untuk perjalanan
            satu hingga dua hari.
          </p>
          <div class="price">
            Rp 899.000
            <a href="#">→</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gear-card">
        <div class="gear-image">🥾</div>
        <div class="gear-info">
          <small>FOOTWEAR</small>
          <h3>Mountain Trek Boots</h3>
          <p>
            Sepatu dengan grip kuat dan perlindungan ekstra untuk
            medan berbatu dan licin.
          </p>
          <div class="price">
            Rp 1.249.000
            <a href="#">→</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gear-card">
        <div class="gear-image">⛺</div>
        <div class="gear-info">
          <small>SHELTER</small>
          <h3>Ultralight Tent</h3>
          <p>
            Tenda compact dan ringan untuk camping di alam terbuka.
          </p>
          <div class="price">
            Rp 1.599.000
            <a href="#">→</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gear-card">
        <div class="gear-image">🧥</div>
        <div class="gear-info">
          <small>APPAREL</small>
          <h3>Windbreaker Jacket</h3>
          <p>
            Jaket ringan tahan angin untuk menghadapi cuaca gunung
            yang berubah-ubah.
          </p>
          <div class="price">
            Rp 649.000
            <a href="#">→</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section class="features" id="about">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="label">Why TerraHike</span>
      <h2>Lebih siap sebelum melangkah.</h2>
      <p>
        Kami membantu pendaki mempersiapkan perjalanan dari pemilihan
        gear hingga perencanaan perjalanan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">

      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">🗺️</div>
        <h3>Trail Guide</h3>
        <p>
          Temukan informasi mengenai jalur, tingkat kesulitan,
          dan persiapan sebelum mendaki.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏕️</div>
        <h3>Outdoor Gear</h3>
        <p>
          Pilih perlengkapan berdasarkan kebutuhan, medan,
          durasi perjalanan, dan kondisi cuaca.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">🌲</div>
        <h3>Leave No Trace</h3>
        <p>
          Nikmati alam sekaligus menjaga kelestariannya untuk
          generasi pendaki berikutnya.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIPS -->
  <section id="tips">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="label">Hiking Tips</span>
      <h2>Persiapkan perjalanan dengan benar.</h2>
      <p>
        Pendakian yang menyenangkan dimulai dari persiapan yang matang.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="tips-grid">

      <div class="tip-main">
        <h3>Checklist sebelum mendaki</h3>
        <p>
          Pastikan kebutuhan dasar berikut sudah siap sebelum berangkat.
        </p>

        <ul class="tip-list">
          <li>Cek kondisi cuaca dan jalur pendakian</li>
          <li>Bawa air minum yang cukup</li>
          <li>Gunakan sepatu dengan grip yang baik</li>
          <li>Siapkan first aid kit</li>
          <li>Bawa headlamp dan baterai cadangan</li>
          <li>Beritahu orang lain mengenai rencana perjalanan</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="tip-side">
        <h3>“The mountains are calling.”</h3>
        <p>
          Jangan hanya mengejar puncak. Nikmati perjalanan,
          hormati alam, dan pulang dengan selamat.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta" id="contact">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2>Ready for your next adventure?</h2>
      <p>
        Siapkan gear-mu, pilih jalur favoritmu, dan mulai petualangan
        berikutnya bersama TerraHike.
      </p>
      <a href="#gear" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Gear →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    <div>
      <strong>TerraHike</strong><br>
      Hiking • Outdoor • Adventure
    </div>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#gear">Gear</a>
      <a href="#tips">Tips</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
    </div>

    <div>
      © 2026 TerraHike
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
